World "Normal"
Title "Normal Subgroups"

Introduction "
Subgroups are closed under their own group operations. Normality adds closure
under conjugation by elements of the whole group. We will use trivial subgroups,
abelian groups, and kernels as examples, then connect normality to left and right cosets.
"
